    "content": "By Aishwarya S Iyer, CNN\nNew Delhi (CNN) \u2014 As pollution worsens in the Indian capital, parents are facing an impossible choice: stay or go.\nAmrita Rosha, 45, is among those choosing to flee with her children. Both of them \u2014 Vanaaya, 4, and Abhiraj, 9... [7629 chars]",
